#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_gap.php:12
msgid ""
"The billing shown is the last one before the break. Either it ends too "
"early, or the one after it starts too late."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazená fakturace je poslední před mezerou. Buď končí příliš brzy, nebo ta "
"následující začíná příliš pozdě."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_gap.php:26
msgid "Billing Resumes"
msgstr "Fakturace pokračuje"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_gap.php:27
msgid "Days Not Billed"
msgstr "Dnů bez fakturace"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_service_type_mismatch.php:11
msgid ""
"Every report that counts what is sold by kind of service counts these under "
"the wrong heading."
msgstr ""
"Každý přehled, který počítá prodej podle druhu služby, tyhle počítá pod "
"špatnou položkou."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_service_type_mismatch.php:21
msgid "The Service Is For"
msgstr "Typ podle služby"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_service_type_mismatch.php:22
msgid "The Contract Is For"
msgstr "Typ podle smlouvy"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/contract_version_gap.php:11
msgid ""
"Not always a fault: a contract can lapse and be signed again. The other "
"reading is a mistyped date."
msgstr ""
"Ne vždy chyba: smlouva mohla vypršet a být znovu podepsaná. Druhé čtení je "
"překlep v datu."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/contract_version_gap.php:22
msgid "Next One In Force From"
msgstr "Další platná od"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/contract_version_gap.php:23
msgid "Days Without a Version"
msgstr "Dnů bez verze"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_billing_period.php:11
msgid "A billing that ends before it begins invoices nothing at all."
msgstr "Fakturace, která končí dřív, než začíná, nenafakturuje vůbec nic."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_borrowed_period.php:11
msgid ""
"Equipment cannot come back before it went out. Until the day is right it is "
"counted somewhere it is not."
msgstr ""
"Zařízení se nemůže vrátit dřív, než bylo vydané. Dokud datum nesedí, je "
"vedené jinde, než ve skutečnosti je."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_contract_dates.php:12
msgid "A service cannot be taken away or stopped before it was ever installed."
msgstr "Službu nelze deinstalovat ani ukončit dřív, než byla nainstalovaná."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_contract_version_period.php:11
msgid ""
"A version cannot end before it begins, and its minimum term cannot be over "
"before the version exists."
msgstr ""
"Verze nemůže skončit dřív, než začne, a její závazek nemůže vypršet dřív, "
"než verze vznikne."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/inactive_with_billing.php:13
msgid ""
"What puts a contract here is the billing running on past the day the "
"contract itself stopped."
msgstr ""
"Na seznam se smlouva dostane tím, že fakturace běží dál i po dni, kdy "
"smlouva sama skončila."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/inactive_with_billing.php:27
msgid "Billed Until"
msgstr "Fakturováno do"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/inactive_with_billing.php:57
#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:41
#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_contract_versions.php:35
msgid "open"
msgstr "otevřená"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/non_standard_service.php:11
msgid ""
"Not a fault on its own. Where the same thing is written by hand again and "
"again, it is a service the price list is still missing."
msgstr ""
"Samo o sobě to není chyba. Když se totéž píše ručně znovu a znovu, chybí ta "
"služba v ceníku."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:11
msgid ""
"The billing shown is the earlier of the two. Usually it was left open when "
"the next one was written - and two tariffs at once are an overlap however "
"differently they are named."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazená fakturace je ta dřívější z dvojice. Obvykle jí při psaní té další "
"zůstal otevřený konec — a dva tarify naráz jsou překryv, i když se jmenují "
"jinak."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:26
msgid "Billed Twice From"
msgstr "Dvojí fakturace od"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:27
msgid "Overlaps With"
msgstr "Překrývá se s"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_contract_versions.php:11
msgid ""
"The version shown is the earlier of the two. While both are in force nothing "
"can say which terms apply."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazená verze je ta dřívější z dvojice. Dokud platí obě, nelze říct, které "
"podmínky platí."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_contract_versions.php:22
msgid "Second One In Force From"
msgstr "Druhá platná od"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsent_proposal.php:11
msgid ""
"The proposal was drawn up and never sent. The day it takes effect comes "
"whether or not the customer has seen the papers."
msgstr ""
"Návrh je založený a nikdy neodešel. Den účinnosti nastane, ať už zákazník "
"papíry viděl, nebo ne."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsettled_obligation.php:11
msgid ""
"Either something is owed and nobody has asked for it, or it was waived and "
"nobody has ticked \"obligations settled\"."
msgstr ""
"Buď se něco dluží a nikdo o to neřekl, nebo se to odpustilo a nikdo "
"nezaškrtl „Závazky vypořádány“."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:17
msgid ""
"Either nothing says when it was concluded, or what says so is from long "
"before it took effect."
msgstr ""
"Buď nic neříká, kdy byla uzavřená, nebo je to z doby dlouho před začátkem "
"její platnosti."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:36
msgid "Deadline"
msgstr "Lhůta"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:80
msgid "Due to be cut off"
msgstr "K odpojení"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:82
msgid "Due a reminder"
msgstr "K upomínce"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:84
msgid "In time until {0}"
msgstr "V termínu do {0}"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:59
msgctxt "sending date"
msgid "Not recorded"
msgstr "Nezaznamenáno"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_proposal.php:11
msgid ""
"The papers went out and have not come back signed. Nothing is carried over "
"into the records until they do."
msgstr ""
"Papíry odešly a nevrátily se podepsané. Dokud se nevrátí, nic se do záznamů "
"nepřenese."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/untransferred_proposal.php:11
msgid ""
"The customer has agreed to something and the records still say the old "
"thing, so the service runs and is invoiced on the old terms until somebody "
"carries it over."
msgstr ""
"Zákazník s něčím souhlasil a záznamy stále říkají to staré, takže služba "
"běží a fakturuje se za starých podmínek, dokud to někdo nepřenese."

